WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Intake rocker arm B
What it does: Transfers the movement of a fixed cam profile to a valve.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Intake rocker arm B
How it works: The rocker pivots and operates one valve.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Intake rocker arm B
How it moves: Pivots on its support to open the valve; the spring follows the return of the fixed profile.
